WEBVTT

00:00.600 --> 00:02.980
Dragon...

00:02.980 --> 00:05.480
Smash!

00:08.940 --> 00:10.650
Whoa, awesome!

00:10.650 --> 00:11.900
I-I did it!

00:12.160 --> 00:16.780
You just have to store up spirit, hone it, 
give it a "hiyah," and then go "bang!"

00:17.080 --> 00:19.930
Man, I'm surprised you pulled 
it off based on that, Clay.

00:21.240 --> 00:22.530
Sophie!

00:22.530 --> 00:24.720
Do you want to learn how to use it, too?

00:25.670 --> 00:27.540
No need to be shy!

00:29.520 --> 00:30.240
Yeah.

00:30.240 --> 00:33.290
You just store up spirit, hone it, give 
it a "gyuwawah," and then go "boom!"

00:33.290 --> 00:33.870
Huh?

00:33.870 --> 00:35.010
That's not what he said.

00:35.010 --> 00:36.340
Wait, really?

00:40.690 --> 00:42.440
Dragon Smash.

00:51.980 --> 00:53.290
What's going on?!

00:53.290 --> 00:56.360
Well, this is what Dragon Smash 
is supposed to look like.

00:56.360 --> 00:57.450
Seriously?!

00:57.450 --> 00:59.030
Clay's was so wimpy!

01:00.240 --> 01:02.310
You're really amazing, Sophie.

01:02.310 --> 01:04.380
It took me so many days to get it.

01:04.380 --> 01:05.440
Everyone, get away from her.

01:05.440 --> 01:05.790
What?!

01:12.340 --> 01:13.300
Blade.

01:13.710 --> 01:15.810
This is my battle to fight.

01:16.280 --> 01:17.680
I'll protect you.

01:20.380 --> 01:23.100
Th-There are two Sophies?!

01:23.990 --> 01:25.770
Wh-What's the meaning of this?!

01:25.770 --> 01:27.100
A duplication technique?

01:28.640 --> 01:30.110
Dragon Smash.

01:36.090 --> 01:37.600
What <i>was</i> that?

01:37.600 --> 01:38.610
Beats me.

01:49.210 --> 01:53.220
<i>I look in your eyes, and I'm met with</i>

01:53.220 --> 01:57.770
<i>A brand-new me and dream</i>

02:07.810 --> 02:10.520
<i>Bravery? Naturally?</i>

02:10.520 --> 02:13.110
<i>Polar opposites within the heart</i>

02:13.110 --> 02:15.780
<i>But, you know, wanting to have both</i>

02:15.780 --> 02:18.410
<i>That's the saga of human nature</i>

02:18.410 --> 02:20.970
<i>Oh no, don't mind me</i>

02:20.970 --> 02:23.910
<i>Go ahead, and so on, you know the rest</i>

02:23.910 --> 02:26.170
<i>A little more? Wait, even harder?!</i>

02:26.170 --> 02:29.080
<i>Going overboard much?</i>

02:29.080 --> 02:31.090
<i>Those selfish emotions deep down</i>

02:31.090 --> 02:33.670
<i>Bringing them to light is 
what friendship's about</i>

02:33.670 --> 02:36.680
<i>Spending adolescence duking it out with pals</i>

02:36.680 --> 02:39.930
<i>I don't wanna lose</i>

02:40.350 --> 02:43.230
<i>We're off to the cutting edge moment</i>

02:43.230 --> 02:47.060
<i>Fight with best friends, and leave no regrets</i>

02:47.060 --> 02:52.020
<i>You should laugh, since 
you look best with a smile</i>

02:52.020 --> 02:57.650
<i>On the ropes?! No matter 
what we face, et cetera</i>

02:57.650 --> 03:00.660
<i>Just sit back and enjoy it</i>

03:00.660 --> 03:07.850
<i>Whatever may come, I'll 
be here to protect you</i>

03:12.960 --> 03:18.460
<b>Episode 11</b>

03:13.000 --> 03:18.460
<b>The Sophie Series (Part 1)</b>

03:28.450 --> 03:29.680
I'm back.

03:31.410 --> 03:34.060
Une must have failed her mission.

03:34.480 --> 03:36.640
Yo, you can't be serious!

03:36.640 --> 03:40.800
What a pain! Let's just go in guns blazing,
 and kill everyone in sight!

03:40.800 --> 03:42.490
C'mon, it's killing time!

03:44.380 --> 03:45.590
Une.

03:45.590 --> 03:48.080
Did you find anyone cute worth killing?

03:48.670 --> 03:50.200
Destroy! Destroy!

03:50.650 --> 03:54.990
This was an undercover scouting mission, 
in order to assess the situation.

03:54.990 --> 03:57.310
In that regard, it was a success.

03:57.310 --> 03:59.260
You really did fail the mission.

03:59.610 --> 04:02.340
Your lack of proof just confirms it...

04:02.340 --> 04:03.490
Une can't do anything.

04:03.490 --> 04:04.840
So useless...

04:05.370 --> 04:06.050
Cinq.

04:06.920 --> 04:08.350
You have permission to destroy.

04:09.040 --> 04:10.390
Destroy! Destroy!

04:12.350 --> 04:15.270
Time to destroy Trois!

04:17.130 --> 04:18.730
Destroy! Destroy!

04:18.730 --> 04:19.990
It hurts!

04:18.730 --> 04:20.920
So, what was the outcome?

04:21.730 --> 04:23.150
I had them teach me.

04:23.570 --> 04:24.340
Huh?

04:24.340 --> 04:25.910
Be a little clearer.

04:26.370 --> 04:28.610
It's hard to explain with just words.

04:28.610 --> 04:30.310
In that case...

04:33.710 --> 04:39.380
Transmitting empirical data through
 mucosal contact is certainly useful.

04:40.020 --> 04:40.880
Deux.

04:40.880 --> 04:41.630
Huh?

04:42.750 --> 04:43.760
It hurts!

04:43.760 --> 04:44.410
Destroy!

04:44.410 --> 04:46.140
I said it hurts, jackass!

04:48.620 --> 04:50.090
Come here, Trois.

04:50.090 --> 04:50.890
You too, Cinq.

05:00.070 --> 05:02.020
Huh? What was your goal here?

05:02.020 --> 05:04.400
Like I said, I had them teach me.

05:04.400 --> 05:05.900
Dragon Smash.

05:07.530 --> 05:09.360
Dragon Smash!

05:12.750 --> 05:15.520
You know this isn't our goal.

05:15.520 --> 05:16.870
Totally not!

05:16.870 --> 05:18.960
What we were commanded to do...

05:18.960 --> 05:20.790
Assassination! Assassination!

05:22.310 --> 05:24.310
Yes. You're absolutely right.

05:40.080 --> 05:41.590
What are you about to show us?

05:41.590 --> 05:43.440
Just be quiet and watch!

05:43.690 --> 05:45.810
Here I go!

05:53.400 --> 05:55.540
Eliza, this is incredible!

05:55.820 --> 05:59.120
It's still a prototype,
but it looks like it worked!

05:59.120 --> 06:01.280
So, which part of that was impressive?

06:01.280 --> 06:04.050
All it did was fire off some 
stored-up spirit over and over.

06:04.050 --> 06:06.390
I don't need the opinion of a superorganism

06:06.390 --> 06:08.430
who can hone and store his spirit
 all by himself!

06:08.690 --> 06:11.390
That's hard for us regular human beings!

06:11.390 --> 06:12.620
It's hard, huh?

06:12.620 --> 06:13.430
However!

06:13.670 --> 06:16.610
By honing spirit and charging 
it up into these cartridges,

06:16.610 --> 06:19.750
now anyone can activate it at 
any time that they see fit!

06:19.750 --> 06:20.940
I get it now.

06:25.160 --> 06:25.760
Blade.

06:25.760 --> 06:27.500
Oh, she's here.

06:33.400 --> 06:35.350
What do <i>you</i> want to learn?

06:39.840 --> 06:41.380
How to make babies?

06:42.380 --> 06:43.280
Eh?

06:43.280 --> 06:45.300
You know that's not happening!

06:46.210 --> 06:47.620
Then...

06:47.620 --> 06:48.920
How I can kill you!

06:50.140 --> 06:51.430
I'm fine with that.

06:51.710 --> 06:53.180
You are?

06:53.680 --> 06:55.350
Time to die, then!

06:55.350 --> 06:57.270
Sure. Come at me!

07:06.420 --> 07:07.790
I can't kill you!

07:07.790 --> 07:08.990
Do a better job teaching me!

07:08.990 --> 07:10.000
What?!

07:10.000 --> 07:13.120
But if I actually teach you,
 I'll end up dead!

07:13.120 --> 07:14.690
Then...

07:16.710 --> 07:18.540
Kill me instead.

07:18.910 --> 07:20.380
Hey, Sophie!

07:22.950 --> 07:23.670
What?!

07:23.670 --> 07:24.460
Th-That's...

07:26.130 --> 07:27.860
S-Sophie?!

07:28.720 --> 07:29.700
Ah, Sophie.

07:29.700 --> 07:32.470
Just when we were getting to the good part.

07:32.870 --> 07:35.300
I'm the one you're up against.

07:36.950 --> 07:38.460
Well, bye now.

07:40.810 --> 07:42.700
How many does that make?

07:42.700 --> 07:44.230
First, the one with a sword.

07:44.230 --> 07:47.350
After that, a club, then a spear...

07:47.350 --> 07:48.480
So this is the fourth?

07:53.240 --> 07:54.740
Here, open wide.

07:54.740 --> 07:56.780
Ahh!

07:57.780 --> 08:00.590
Hey, what do you think is 
the deal with those girls?

08:00.590 --> 08:03.490
I'm not sure, but they're good learners.

08:03.490 --> 08:06.700
Yeah, they're really passionate.

08:06.700 --> 08:08.300
I wouldn't call it passion...

08:08.530 --> 08:10.720
Do you think they're Sophie's sisters?

08:10.720 --> 08:13.200
They should all just enroll in the academy.

08:13.200 --> 08:14.590
Hold on, Anna.

08:14.590 --> 08:16.190
Let's think this through a bit.

08:16.190 --> 08:18.630
Don't you find it at least a little weird?

08:18.630 --> 08:19.140
Huh?

08:19.540 --> 08:22.480
You've become a lot like Blade lately.

08:22.480 --> 08:25.440
In your lack of common sense, that is.

08:25.440 --> 08:26.520
Ahem.

08:26.760 --> 08:31.400
Do you have anything to say about the 
unusual situation we find ourselves in?

08:31.400 --> 08:33.130
She's gone into Empress mode.

08:33.130 --> 08:34.220
Um...

08:34.660 --> 08:36.660
Do you mind if I say something?

08:36.930 --> 08:38.160
Go ahead.

08:38.160 --> 08:38.910
Well...

08:38.910 --> 08:41.250
From an outside perspective, 
it seems clear to me...

08:41.250 --> 08:45.250
that those girls are seriously 
trying to kill Blade!

08:45.770 --> 08:49.000
I do the same thing when 
I attack him during lessons.

08:49.000 --> 08:50.450
Me, too!

08:50.450 --> 08:52.420
If anything, I'd finish him off.

08:52.420 --> 08:56.220
Don't forget that I'm the 
one who will kill him.

08:56.220 --> 08:58.260
What?! Um, sorry!

08:58.260 --> 08:59.990
Sorry, sorry, sorry!

08:59.990 --> 09:02.270
Lay off her already. 
Can't you see that she's scared?

09:02.660 --> 09:05.770
Am I being scolded by Blade?!

09:05.140 --> 09:05.770
<b>BA-DUMP</b>

09:05.770 --> 09:08.970
Um, I didn't mean it in 
the way that you all do.

09:08.970 --> 09:10.930
Pretending to be Sophie to get close to him...

09:10.930 --> 09:12.580
Attacking him with clear murderous intent...

09:12.580 --> 09:13.530
That has to be...

09:13.980 --> 09:16.160
Um, give me a second here.

09:16.160 --> 09:21.540
The most probable conclusion we can 
arrive at from all of these facts is...

09:24.170 --> 09:26.960
that Blade is being targeted by assassins!

09:28.870 --> 09:29.920
Sophie!

09:30.580 --> 09:32.110
What's wrong?

09:32.110 --> 09:36.760
I just found out that none of you 
realized that they were assassins.

09:37.310 --> 09:39.120
Wait! D-Don't worry!

09:39.120 --> 09:41.640
We knew all along! We really did!

09:41.640 --> 09:43.700
I had it figured out from the start.

09:43.700 --> 09:45.670
Act a little scared about it, then!

09:45.670 --> 09:48.270
Is someone after your life, Parent?

09:48.590 --> 09:49.700
It's fine.

09:50.200 --> 09:52.270
I'll protect Blade.

10:01.780 --> 10:03.260
You all failed!

10:03.260 --> 10:04.190
It's me next!

10:04.190 --> 10:05.960
I'll destroy! Destroy!

10:05.960 --> 10:06.810
Can I destroy him?

10:06.810 --> 10:07.860
Shut your trap.

10:07.860 --> 10:09.290
You're giving me a headache.

10:09.990 --> 10:12.310
I haven't failed yet.

10:12.310 --> 10:13.290
That must be it.

10:13.290 --> 10:15.800
The lack of proof just confirms it.

10:16.020 --> 10:18.760
The Great Hero couldn't kill me.

10:19.760 --> 10:23.660
That means I can kill him next time, right?

10:23.660 --> 10:24.860
Destroy, destroy!

10:24.490 --> 10:25.810
Be quiet.

10:24.860 --> 10:25.810
Destroy everything!

10:26.530 --> 10:30.900
Wasting unnecessary energy
 will only shorten your lifespan.

10:31.400 --> 10:32.290
Une.

10:34.060 --> 10:36.270
Deux. Trois.

10:36.690 --> 10:37.830
Quatre.

10:39.530 --> 10:40.450
Cinq.

10:42.580 --> 10:45.320
It's up to you to show everyone

10:45.320 --> 10:49.040
that an Artificial Great Hero can 
surpass even the Great Hero himself.

10:49.640 --> 10:56.100
Kill the Great Hero Blade, 
and prove the validity of our research.

10:56.970 --> 10:58.420
We understand.

10:58.860 --> 11:03.060
That is the sole reason that 
we were brought to life.

11:06.870 --> 11:09.320
We're the strongest!

11:27.460 --> 11:29.130
Is that you, Sophie?

11:29.130 --> 11:30.040
Yes.

11:30.040 --> 11:31.990
Please deactivate your stealth.

11:31.990 --> 11:34.770
It makes it difficult to 
detect you with my sensors.

11:34.770 --> 11:37.030
I don't want to wake Blade up.

11:37.030 --> 11:39.050
Are you worried about Master?

11:39.050 --> 11:40.050
There is no need to worry.

11:40.410 --> 11:42.480
I am always by his side.

11:44.920 --> 11:47.060
Would you like to sleep next to him as well?

11:47.410 --> 11:49.840
Now is your chance to do so
 as much as you like.

11:49.840 --> 11:51.060
No, thanks.

11:51.060 --> 11:53.020
Please leave it to me.

11:53.020 --> 11:55.310
I will protect Master with my life.

11:55.990 --> 11:59.100
I'll do what I can to protect Blade, too.

11:59.650 --> 12:01.390
Even if it means death.

12:09.490 --> 12:10.510
Give up.

12:10.510 --> 12:12.540
You can't kill Blade.

12:12.540 --> 12:14.460
We won't let you.

12:14.460 --> 12:16.000
No, we will.

12:16.000 --> 12:20.210
That is what we were commanded to do, 
and the only purpose of our lives.

12:21.090 --> 12:25.440
The Artificial Great Hero Project was 
abandoned, with me as the final subject.

12:25.440 --> 12:29.720
The modifications you received did 
not follow the proper procedure.

12:29.720 --> 12:32.980
That must have had a considerable 
impact on your bodies.

12:32.980 --> 12:34.290
I know that.

12:34.290 --> 12:36.890
We have very short lifespan,

12:36.890 --> 12:38.230
unlike you.

12:38.840 --> 12:42.660
Instead of using the limited time
 left to you to obey commands,

12:42.660 --> 12:45.490
can't you live as humans, 
and spend it in the light of day?

12:45.740 --> 12:47.200
Our orders are absolute.

12:47.200 --> 12:49.120
If you want to stop us...

12:49.120 --> 12:50.740
There's only one way.

12:53.600 --> 12:55.580
Deep down, I'm sure you've realized it, too.

13:14.790 --> 13:16.060
We'll be waiting.

13:17.040 --> 13:19.730
In our world, where the 
light of day does not reach.

13:32.010 --> 13:34.040
Sophie is pint-sized today!

13:35.310 --> 13:36.320
Cinq!

13:36.320 --> 13:36.740
Hm?

13:36.740 --> 13:38.210
My name is Cinq!

13:38.210 --> 13:39.550
Not Sophie!

13:39.550 --> 13:41.510
So they have their own names.

13:41.510 --> 13:45.130
I believe that Cinq is an ancient lost word

13:45.130 --> 13:47.340
that signifies the number five.

13:47.940 --> 13:49.610
Are there only five of you?

13:50.610 --> 13:52.260
Is it okay for you to tell us that?

13:52.870 --> 13:53.600
It wasn't!

13:53.600 --> 13:58.100
Well, I don't think she could have 
pretended to be Sophie if she tried.

13:58.100 --> 13:59.700
Forget I said that!

13:59.700 --> 14:01.540
Or else I'll destroy you!

14:00.470 --> 14:01.540
Okay, okay!

14:01.540 --> 14:02.230
I forgot it!

14:02.230 --> 14:03.900
Good, good.

14:03.900 --> 14:08.570
But I'm still gonna destroy you!

14:11.570 --> 14:12.740
Hey, Blade!

14:12.740 --> 14:14.430
Stick to the plan!

14:14.430 --> 14:15.950
I know I should!

14:18.520 --> 14:21.090
Destroy! Destroy! Destroy!

14:23.930 --> 14:27.510
Not even a superorganism 
can withstand that...

14:28.760 --> 14:31.600
Destroy! Destroy! Destroy!

14:33.530 --> 14:34.510
Blade.

14:34.510 --> 14:35.950
C'mon, wake up.

14:35.950 --> 14:37.620
How long are you going to stay dead?

14:38.040 --> 14:39.900
He finally woke up!

14:39.900 --> 14:43.360
Master won every exercise 
that took place in virtual reality.

14:43.360 --> 14:45.280
He is unaccustomed to dying.

14:45.590 --> 14:47.120
Where's Cinq?!

14:47.120 --> 14:48.300
She left already.

14:48.300 --> 14:50.280
In an extremely good mood, at that.

14:50.280 --> 14:54.310
I don't think she realized she had 
been led into virtual reality.

14:54.310 --> 14:57.120
So, if she's convinced that she 
killed Mr. Superorganism,

14:57.120 --> 14:59.070
our plan is a success!

14:59.070 --> 15:00.480
I just hope she doesn't find out.

15:00.480 --> 15:01.610
I know, right?

15:01.610 --> 15:03.080
If she does...

15:04.460 --> 15:06.870
You tricked me!

15:06.870 --> 15:09.000
Destroy! Destroy! Destroy! Destroy!

15:09.000 --> 15:10.930
Lemme destroy you!

15:09.740 --> 15:11.570
I knew that's how she'd react!

15:11.570 --> 15:13.110
Destroy! Destroy! Destroy!

15:13.110 --> 15:14.470
Whoa, she's pissed!

15:14.800 --> 15:17.900
Academy Building No. 2 is at 30% damage.

15:17.900 --> 15:20.410
Any more damage carries the risk of collapse,

15:20.410 --> 15:23.690
so I propose that we relocate to Building 
No. 3, which has been fully evacuated.

15:23.690 --> 15:25.200
Well, tell <i>her</i> that!

15:25.200 --> 15:27.440
I'm sure she wouldn't listen!

15:30.130 --> 15:32.280
I can kill him, right?!

15:32.280 --> 15:32.820
Right?!

15:37.020 --> 15:39.120
I'm here to kill you, so stop running!

15:39.120 --> 15:41.250
Destroy! Destroy! Destroy!

15:41.250 --> 15:42.700
I will proceed to steer them.

15:42.700 --> 15:44.210
Leave it to me.

15:47.600 --> 15:50.720
Yo momma's got a big ol' outie!

15:51.150 --> 15:52.720
What's that mean?

15:52.720 --> 15:55.770
It is a phrase used to taunt 
others in a lost ancient language.

15:55.770 --> 15:58.640
Unfortunately, its meaning has 
been deleted from my records.

16:00.850 --> 16:02.580
It worked!

16:04.720 --> 16:05.530
Here they come!

16:05.530 --> 16:06.900
It's up to all of you!

16:06.900 --> 16:08.170
Understood!

16:08.680 --> 16:09.860
But, Altia...

16:09.860 --> 16:12.610
Are we really strong enough to defeat them?

16:12.610 --> 16:14.980
We messed up during our last exam...

16:14.980 --> 16:16.490
Can we really do it?

16:16.490 --> 16:17.940
Well...

16:18.400 --> 16:19.490
You'll be fine.

16:19.910 --> 16:21.970
It's okay if you don't want to kill anyone.

16:21.970 --> 16:23.610
They're on the same level as Sophie.

16:23.610 --> 16:25.490
Launch your spells at them, 
and don't hold back!

16:25.490 --> 16:26.250
Yes!

16:27.800 --> 16:28.750
You've got this!

16:33.050 --> 16:34.470
Fire!

16:52.630 --> 16:54.680
Blade, you can also use magic?

16:54.680 --> 16:56.320
Hm? A little.

16:56.630 --> 16:59.000
Now is your chance to take them alive.

16:59.520 --> 17:01.730
What? That wasn't enough?!

17:05.200 --> 17:07.320
Artificial Great Hero Power!

17:07.320 --> 17:08.580
You'd better stand back.

17:08.580 --> 17:09.340
Eh?

17:12.580 --> 17:13.700
Master.

17:13.700 --> 17:15.390
That is a black hole.

17:15.390 --> 17:17.090
I propose that we withdraw immediately.

17:17.440 --> 17:18.600
Otherwise...

17:26.710 --> 17:28.060
Hold out for ten seconds!

17:34.570 --> 17:38.280
You think it's over? No way.

17:38.640 --> 17:40.790
Destroy! Destroy! Destroy!

17:40.790 --> 17:44.020
Once a black hole has formed, 
it will not die out by itself.

17:44.020 --> 17:44.910
What?!

17:45.660 --> 17:48.420
Okay, what now?

17:50.120 --> 17:51.250
Altia!

18:00.160 --> 18:01.100
Sophie!

18:04.070 --> 18:06.100
Artificial Great Hero Power.

18:06.370 --> 18:09.100
Ten. Nine. Eight.

18:09.440 --> 18:11.360
Seven. Six.

18:11.840 --> 18:13.610
Five. Four.

18:14.200 --> 18:16.540
Three... Two...

18:17.400 --> 18:18.610
One...

18:28.880 --> 18:30.940
You did well, Sophie.

18:32.350 --> 18:33.550
Blade...

19:11.440 --> 19:14.270
Oh, you're awake?

19:16.670 --> 19:19.220
You're supposed to cut 
them like rabbits, right?

19:19.460 --> 19:20.640
Did I get it right?

19:21.480 --> 19:23.220
You're right about the rabbits.

19:23.520 --> 19:25.940
But wrong about how you cut them.

19:25.940 --> 19:28.220
Huh? I'm not supposed to use this?

19:31.300 --> 19:32.230
Any casualities?

19:32.470 --> 19:34.630
Ah, no one died.

19:34.630 --> 19:36.250
A few people were injured,

19:36.250 --> 19:38.660
but it's okay, since Claire 
healed them in time.

19:38.660 --> 19:40.540
And I just got a few scrapes.

19:41.020 --> 19:42.240
I see.

19:42.240 --> 19:44.240
Sorry for causing so much trouble.

19:44.240 --> 19:47.020
We're all fine with it, so no worries.

19:49.770 --> 19:52.140
Can you tell me about them?

19:54.550 --> 19:57.380
Those girls... are me.

19:57.910 --> 20:02.620
Specimens created with the same cloning 
technology, with further modifications...

20:03.400 --> 20:06.100
and successfully manifested 
Artificial Great Hero powers

20:06.100 --> 20:09.590
after receiving implants 
of the rare metal Heronium.

20:09.590 --> 20:13.100
They've been given numbers, 
so I feel like that must be the case.

20:13.560 --> 20:16.990
You mean the Artificial Great Hero Project?

20:17.790 --> 20:20.390
I was rescued by the king,

20:20.890 --> 20:24.610
but those girls didn't 
have anyone to help them.

20:25.200 --> 20:29.820
I met you at this academy, 
and made friends with everyone.

20:30.560 --> 20:32.250
You were my salvation.

20:32.560 --> 20:34.830
You're the one who saved me.

20:35.310 --> 20:38.780
You've suffered so much, all because 
of the Great Hero's powers.

20:38.780 --> 20:41.630
And yet you forgave me, the Great Hero.

20:42.030 --> 20:43.390
I already told you.

20:43.390 --> 20:45.870
I take pride in these powers of mine.

20:45.870 --> 20:48.010
I never once resented you.

20:48.610 --> 20:51.310
I want to be friends with them, too.

20:53.010 --> 20:56.560
Earnest suggested that all five of 
them should enroll in this school.

20:56.560 --> 20:57.780
That can't happen.

20:57.780 --> 20:58.310
Huh?

20:59.000 --> 21:04.640
The Artificial Great Heroes were born to 
defeat the Great Hero... that is, you.

21:04.640 --> 21:08.200
Their sole purpose in life is to surpass you.

21:08.780 --> 21:12.050
I was rescued before any 
neural modifications,

21:12.050 --> 21:14.210
so I wasn't programmed as such...

21:14.480 --> 21:17.020
but those girls can't disobey their orders.

21:17.940 --> 21:19.040
And besides...

22:18.600 --> 22:23.660
<i>The sunny disposition that 
brings a smile to your face</i>

22:23.660 --> 22:29.410
<i>As well as the heroic sense of justice</i>

22:29.410 --> 22:34.580
<i>They may be a part of me, 
but that's not all there is</i>

22:34.580 --> 22:37.280
<i>That image of me</i>

22:37.280 --> 22:40.000
<i>Has taken on a life of its own</i>

22:40.000 --> 22:42.670
<i>Hey, wait up</i>

22:42.670 --> 22:45.090
<i>Won't you be friends with me?</i>

22:45.090 --> 22:49.780
<i>Let's shake hands, another self of mine</i>

22:50.440 --> 22:53.200
<i>The wounds we cannot bear alone</i>

22:53.200 --> 22:55.870
<i>The dangers that we keep hidden</i>

22:55.870 --> 22:58.540
<i>We're all hiding them within</i>

22:58.540 --> 23:01.530
<i>Standing ready to strike</i>

23:01.530 --> 23:03.960
<i>The shadow lurking beneath the light</i>

23:03.960 --> 23:08.240
<i>The muffled sounds coming from my lips</i>

23:08.240 --> 23:13.720
<i>They make me feel that I am alive</i>

23:13.720 --> 23:15.560
<i>It's a sign</i>

23:34.470 --> 23:40.030
<b>Next Time</b>

23:35.300 --> 23:40.030
<b>The Sophie Series (Part 2)</b>
